an><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">排队；排成一行；相匹敌；媲美；不相上下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229608\">あんた、なぜに<ruby>並<rp>(</rp><rt>なら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいるのだい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What are you lining up for?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">並べる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ならべる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">排列；排成一行；摆成一排；列举；枚举；逐一列出；相等；相当；比得上</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194690\">メイドはテーブルにナイフとフォークを<ruby>並<rp>(</rp><rt>なら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The maid arranged the knives and forks on the table.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">なる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">成为；变成；变得；到了（某时期、年龄）；达到（某数值、状态）；结果是；最终变成；证明是；原来是；由…组成；由…构成；由…组合而成；完成；实现；成功；达成；告成；变为；转化为；化为；开始（做某事）；（渐渐）变得会……；……起来；合计；共计；加起来是；等于；扮演；充当；担任；用作；用于；派得上用场；起……作用；（将棋）升变；（棋子）升级；做…；进行…</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202981\">ちまたではインターネットなるものがはやっています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">People are talking about this Internet phenomenon.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">何</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">什么；那个东西；你懂的；那玩意儿；那什么东西；那谁；阴茎；那话儿；（一点也）不；（毫）不；什么？；嗯？；喂！；搞什么！；什么嘛（表示恼怒）；没事；没关系；哪里</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236417\">「ユリ」を<ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>といいますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What do you call &quot;yuri&quot; in English?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">二</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">に</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">二；2</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">賑やか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にぎやか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">热闹；繁华；兴隆；热闹；响亮；欢快；热烈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220474\">この<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りは<ruby>賑<rp>(</rp><rt>にぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>やかだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This street is lively.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">肉</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">肉；肉；荤；果肉；果实的肉质部分；肉体；血肉之躯（相对于精神）；厚度；厚实的程度；内容；实质；内在的东西；印泥</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"122996\"><ruby>肉<rp>(</rp><rt>にく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはウジがわいていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The meat was crawling with maggots.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">西</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">西；西方</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"77480\"><ruby>列車<rp>(</rp><rt>れっしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>西<rp>(</rp><rt>にし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>走<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The train was hurrying west.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日曜日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にちようび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">星期日</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">日</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日本</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にほん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">日本</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">本</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日本人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にほんじん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">日本人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">人</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">荷物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">にもつ</span></div><di